# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This repository publishes source only. Everything below is excluded on
# purpose, and two of the entries are not merely housekeeping:
#
#   datasets/   human-subject facial video and health biomarkers. UBFC-rPPG
#               ships a data use agreement and forbids reproducing facial
#               images for two of its subjects in any publication; MCD-rPPG
#               pairs 600 people's faces with blood pressure, cholesterol and
#               glycated haemoglobin. None of it is ours to redistribute.
#   research/   copyrighted PDFs of the papers this work is reconstructed from.
#
# Obtain both from their original sources; DATASETS.md records where.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Data and derived artefacts. Anchored with a leading slash so they match only
# the top-level directories: an unanchored `datasets/` also matches the source
# package `src/datasets/`, which silently kept every corpus reader out of the
# repository.
/datasets/
/build/
/models/
/research/

# Vendored third-party checkouts, each with its own .git. tools/*.py is ours
# and is tracked.
tools/rPPG-Toolbox/
tools/PhysBench/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.so
dist/
wheels/
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/

# Tooling caches
.ruff_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Editors and OS
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
.DS_Store

# Notebooks and scratch output
*.ipynb
*.png
*.pt
*.npy
*.parquet
*.log
